OL,3,GNEWSATown festooned with knitted poppy
OL,4,Atributes
OL,5,
OL,6,FScores of volunteer knitters and
OL,7,Fcrocheters have made sure a town was
OL,8,F"painted red" - as well as blue and
OL,9,Fpurple - in time for Remembrance
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,12,FThe Whittlesey Poppy Blitz has taken
OL,13,Fplace for seven years and sees the
OL,14,FCambridgeshire town swathed in
OL,15,Fcolourful woolly displays.
OL,17,FNew pieces have been added annually,
OL,18,Fthis year included a parachute
OL,19,Fregiment, wartime nurses and a tribute
OL,20,Fto carrier pigeons.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
