OL,3,GNEWSATown festooned with knitted poppy
OL,4,Atributes
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteer Amy Wareham, 43, said the
OL,7,Fdisplays relied on the "wonderful work
OL,8,Fof our knitters" who do their best to
OL,9,Fpatch up and mend some of the designs
OL,10,Ffrom previous years, while also
OL,11,Fcreating new ones.
